<QFT version="4" name="ACC'90 benchmark, QFT Toolbox example 5, margin at every frequency" description="Example 5 of the QFT Toolbox manual, with the bound on the sensitivity added here and the stability margin asked at every frequency from 0.0001 to 10^6 rad/s instead of at the design frequencies alone. Eight frequencies between 0.15 and 0.23 rad/s, where a closed-loop pair of the rigid mode resonates, are added where it was exceeded, and the controller meets it over a grid of 1001 frequencies.">
